 .------------------.
 |  FluffyNet Info  |
 `------------------'

 Fluffy Net was a joint creation by Niki Murkett (Redrum BBS)  and Roger
 Wilco (Cyberzone BBS) to be a simple echo network for happy people. :-)

 Please encourage other people to join up, and please write as many msgs
 everyday as you can.

 Any of the BBS's in the `current nodelist' will be able to help you set
 up Fluffy Net.

 This is a BBS based network only and has no attachment to the internet.

 Home of Fluffy Net is Total Eclipse (formerly Dave's Place/Redrum BBS).

 .------------------.
 |  Standard Echos  |
 `------------------'

 FN-GEN          General chat.
 FN-SYSOP        SysOps Only chat.
 FN-AV           Audio/Visual chat (music, graphics, videos etc).
 FN-ESP          Paranoramal/UFO chat.
 FN-HELP         Help on any subject.
 FN-NET          Internet chat (web pages to visit etc).
 FN-ELEC         Electronics chat, amature radio etc.
 FN-CODE         Programmers chat.                                               

 .----------------------.
 |  Joining Fluffy Net  |
 `----------------------'

 To join Fluffy Net, simply contact one of the BBS's in the nodelist.


